        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1. &nbsp;You have to keep it in play. &nbsp;Anything put into play by a power card leaves play when that power card does. &nbsp;Same with Unity&#39;s Golems or Ambuscade&#39;s hunter or Ra&#39;s tornado.</p><p>2. &nbsp;Movement reduction lasts until that player re-rolls movement, and does not affect sprinting or powers that cause you to move.</p>",
